## 📡 API Documentation

### Vehicles API
- `POST /vehicles`: Register a new vehicle.
- `GET /vehicles`: Retrieve all vehicles.
- `GET /vehicles/:id`: Get vehicle details by ID.
- `PUT /vehicles/:id`: Update vehicle information.
- `DELETE /vehicles/:id`: Remove a vehicle.

### Maintenance API
- `GET /maintenance/upcoming`: Retrieve vehicles due for maintenance within 24 hours.

